      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Step 4: Since the slopes of the asymptotes are \\(\\pm 2\\), the hyperbola is oriented horizontally, and its equation can be written as:\n\\[ \\frac{(x-5)^2}{a^2} - \\frac{(y-7)^2}{b^2} = 1 \\]\nGiven \\(\\frac{b}{a} = 2\\), we have \\( b = 2a \\).",
      "z": -0.5825473113367885
    },
